sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant DMInbox
    participant MessageComposer
    participant NIP04Service
    participant EventPublisher
    participant SubscriptionManager
    participant RelayPool

    Note over User,RelayPool: Initial Load - Subscribe to DMs

    User->>DMInbox: Opens DM Inbox
    DMInbox->>SubscriptionManager: subscribe([{kinds: [4], authors: [userPubkey]}])
    SubscriptionManager->>RelayPool: Create subscription
    RelayPool-->>SubscriptionManager: EOSE + Events
    SubscriptionManager-->>DMInbox: DM Events
    DMInbox->>NIP04Service: decrypt(encryptedContent, senderPubkey)
    NIP04Service-->>DMInbox: Decrypted messages
    DMInbox->>User: Display thread list

    Note over User,RelayPool: User Selects Thread

    User->>DMInbox: Click thread
    DMInbox->>DMInbox: Filter messages for thread
    DMInbox->>User: Display conversation view

    Note over User,RelayPool: Send New Message

    User->>MessageComposer: Type message
    User->>MessageComposer: Click Send
    MessageComposer->>NIP04Service: encrypt(message, recipientPubkey)
    NIP04Service-->>MessageComposer: Encrypted content
    MessageComposer->>EventPublisher: createAndPublish({kind: 4, content})
    EventPublisher->>RelayPool: Publish event
    RelayPool-->>EventPublisher: Publish results
    EventPublisher-->>MessageComposer: Success
    MessageComposer->>DMInbox: Update UI optimistically
    DMInbox->>User: Show sent message

    Note over User,RelayPool: Receive New Message

    RelayPool->>SubscriptionManager: New DM event
    SubscriptionManager->>DMInbox: onEvent callback
    DMInbox->>NIP04Service: decrypt(encryptedContent, senderPubkey)
    NIP04Service-->>DMInbox: Decrypted message
    DMInbox->>DMInbox: Add to thread
    DMInbox->>User: Display new message + notification
